{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0720_kojiro_00",
      "hash": "fea20d2f34fd430b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 0]"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0720_musashi_01",
      "hash": "716869af2e38670c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "JESSIE: You...\\nYou’re that twerp from Mt. Moon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0720_musashi_04",
      "hash": "716866af2e3861f3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Just how long are you gonna follow us around?\\nI know I’m beautiful, but what do you want?"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0720_select_01",
      "hash": "6d0c15488af76bc0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "To rescue Cubone"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0720_select_02",
      "hash": "6d0c18488af770d9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "To join Team Rocket"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0720_musashi_05",
      "hash": "716865af2e386040",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "JESSIE: What?! That Cubone?\\nHa! We already gave the poor thing to the boss!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0720_musashi_06",
      "hash": "716868af2e386559",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "JESSIE: What? Really?!\\nYou certainly do show potential. Though you’re\\r\\nnot nearly as beautiful as me...\\c\\nWait a minute—you’re trying to trick me!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0720_musashi_07",
      "hash": "716867af2e3863a6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "JESSIE: It doesn’t matter! There’s no way we’re\\nletting you through to see the boss!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0720_kojiro_01",
      "hash": "fea20c2f34fd4158",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "JAMES: It’s payback time for those Fossils from\\nMt. Moon, you brat!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0720_dummy_01",
      "hash": "c43546420b584cb0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 9]"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0720_dummy_02",
      "hash": "c43549420b5851c9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 10]"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0720_musashi_02",
      "hash": "71686caf2e386c25",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "JESSIE: Hmph! How infuriating!\\c\\nDon’t let it go to your head just because your\\nPokémon were a teeny tiny bit stronger!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0720_kojiro_02",
      "hash": "fea20f2f34fd4671",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "JAMES: Exactly!\\c\\nAnd even if you did defeat us in battle, we’re\\nstill bigger and stronger than you!\\c\\nWe’ll just use brute force to—"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0720_poke_01_01",
      "hash": "22d8a1ef446a6873",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Pikaaa!!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0720_poke_02_01",
      "hash": "f85aa9fa8dd325bc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Veeeeee!!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main0720_kojiro_03",
      "hash": "fea20e2f34fd44be",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "JAMES: Eeek!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main0720_musashi_03",
      "hash": "71686baf2e386a72",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "JESSIE & JAMES: Looks like Team Rocket’s\\nblasting off again!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main0720_poke_01_02",
      "hash": "22d8a2ef446a6a26",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 17]"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_main0720_poke_02_02",
      "hash": "f85aacfa8dd32ad5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 18]"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_main0720_sys_01",
      "hash": "ae0c9f5d0eb57adf",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 19]"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_main0720_sys_02",
      "hash": "ae0ca05d0eb57c92",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 20]"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_main0720_sys_03",
      "hash": "ae0ca15d0eb57e45",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 21]"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_main0720_musashi_back",
      "hash": "e0a3affd79ba23d0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "JESSIE: Hey, twerp, you can’t battle the both of\\nus with just one Pokémon!\\c\\nYou’d better go get another and come back to\\ntake us on!"
    }
  ],
